  "details": "Sometimes when a controller loses tracking due to occlusions/reflections/etc., when the controller reconnects, the buttons are no longer mapped to their respective VRChat actions. So for example if my left controller loses tracking, even after it reconnects I am unable to open my quick menu or toggle my microphone mute, and the only way I can get these functions back is to restart VRChat. The thumb stick continues to work, however, and the buttons do work on the SteamVR overlay.\n\nI do not have this issue on the main branch.",
